<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E rights first leg 90 pct taken.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E rights first leg 90 pct taken.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors subscribed for 802,922 shares in the first subscription period of the Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA 900,000-share rights offer, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The remaining 97,078 shares in the one-for-50 rights issue, priced at one zloty per share, will be offered on April 7-21, it said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
